    "original": "This character's armor's weight is too much. Encumbrance has 4 levels and it increases when the total remaining Fatigue after gear is less than 50, 40, 30, 20. Only applies when the total penalty to Fatigue from head and body armor is at least -20.",
    "translation": "该角色的护甲重量超过了其承受能力。累赘度共分4个等级，分别在疲劳值上限降至50，40，30，20点时生效。仅在头身总护甲疲劳值惩罚超过20点时生效。",
    "stage": 1,
    "context": "this.m.Description = \"This character's armor's weight is too much. Encumbrance has 4 levels and it increases when the total remaining Fatigue after gear is less than 50, 40, 30, 20. Only applies when the total penalty to Fatigue from head and body armor is at least -20.\""
